WEBVTT

00:00:06.617 --> 00:00:12.482
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> She has medium-length brown hair and she’s very tall and slim.

00:00:13.106 --> 00:00:14.704
She’s quite shy.

00:00:22.538 --> 00:00:31.403
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> He has quite short wavy hair, it’s sort of red, and he has a small beard and a moustache.

00:00:32.260 --> 00:00:35.558
He’s a really nice guy, very kind.

00:00:43.578 --> 00:00:46.102
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> She’s very talkative and funny.

00:00:46.993 --> 00:00:52.108
She has curly grey hair, and she wears glasses.

00:01:00.096 --> 00:01:03.842
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> He has short blond hair and blue eyes.

00:01:04.513 --> 00:01:09.242
He’s a big man, well-built, and he’s very tall.

00:01:10.045 --> 00:01:13.790
He’s a great colleague – he’s really hard-working.

00:01:21.232 --> 00:01:24.454
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> She’s very extrovert and friendly.

00:01:25.379 --> 00:01:34.020
She has very curly hair, not short, but not very long, and she has a beautiful smile.

00:01:41.895 --> 00:01:45.496
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> My granddad looks just like my dad.

00:01:45.994 --> 00:01:54.815
He’s quite short, and he has short white hair and a bit of a beard – he doesn’t shave very often.

00:01:55.628 --> 00:02:00.257
He’s really warm and open, and has lots of friends.

00:02:08.355 --> 00:02:15.892
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> She’s really attractive, and she’s a lovely person, very generous to her friends.

00:02:16.937 --> 00:02:20.644
She’s medium height and she’s quite big.

00:02:21.616 --> 00:02:27.598
She has fantastic hair, long and dark and braided.

00:02:36.113 --> 00:02:40.081
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> He isn’t very tall – in fact he’s quite short –

00:02:40.596 --> 00:02:45.456
and he has a beard and a moustache and wavy brown hair.

00:02:46.430 --> 00:02:51.006
He’s OK, but to be honest, I think he’s a bit mean.

00:02:51.578 --> 00:02:53.778
He never pays when we go out!